,{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Retrying matters because the buffers are cleared at flush time: without it a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"failed save only ever reaches disk if the user happens to touch the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity again, which is silent data loss. Retrying ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"forever"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" matters just as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"much in the other direction — a write that can never succeed (disk full, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model the container can’t encode, a schema mismatch) must not keep the stack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"busy indefinitely. So attempts are bounded, and running out is an event the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app can see rather than a silence.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/SQ","doc:\/\/Swidux\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Swidux\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/RetryPolicy":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" retries a flush whose save failed."}],"title":"RetryPolicy","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/retrypolicy","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RetryPolicy"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RetryPolicy"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryP